  "description": "Faran. Road plus, commuting, gravel, audax, randonneuring, or touring. The Faran is your versatile companion.\n\nThe sort of bike that you will become very attached to as you rack up the miles together. As the seasons and years pass; racks and cages will be bolted on or taken off, wheels & tyre sizes will be experimented with; its form, capability and loading capacity will evolve to reflect your riding style. We think, on some level, every cyclist has the desire for self-sufficiency and escape. It’s this idea that drives the utilitarian design ethos of the Faran.\n\nVersatility. A bike that can turn it’s hand to everything.",
